          "snippet": {
            "text": "/-- `μ` is the Möbius function. If `n` is squarefree with an even number of distinct prime factors,\n  `μ n = 1`. If `n` is squarefree with an odd number of distinct prime factors, `μ n = -1`.\n  If `n` is not squarefree, `μ n = 0`. -/\ndef moebius : ArithmeticFunction ℤ :=\n  ⟨fun n => if Squarefree n then (-1) ^ cardFactors n else 0, by simp⟩",
            "line": 49,
            "truncated": false
          },
          "proof_context": {
            "declaration": "ArithmeticFunction.moebius",
            "lines": [
              49,
              53
            ],
            "conclusion": "`μ n = (-1)^{Ω(n)}` if `n` squarefree (`n = p₁…p_k` distinct, `Ω = k`), else `0`."
